ed_Residences_c42db8b74c","name":"Villa Del BRUNELLO at Dubai Islands – Branded Residences"},"style":null,"title":"Boutique Branded Residences Designed for a Select Few","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Prime Waterfront Address – Directly located on the Dubai Islands with panoramic sea views and beachfront access, combining exclusivity with convenience.</li><li>Branded Interiors – Poolside furnished by Dolce&amp;Gabbana Casa, lobbies curated with Cassina, B&amp;B Italia, Lalique, and Lasvit glass art - a rare branded living experience.</li><li>World-Class Amenities &amp; Wellness – Infinity pool, Technogym fitness center by Antonio Citterio, yoga spaces, and concierge services designed for balanced living.</li><li>Developer’s Reputation – Delivered by Mr. Eight Development, a boutique developer known for European craftsmanship, bespoke residences, and design-focused projects.</li><li>Flexible Investment Plans – Investor-friendly payment structure (35/65) with manageable installments and early resale eligibility, enhancing liquidity options.</li><li>Comprehensive Concierge &amp; Services – Rolls-Royce chauffeur cars, Riva motorboats, golf carts with drivers, and bespoke à la carte services tailored to each resident’s lifestyle.</li><li>Integration into Dubai’s 2040 Master Plan – Backed by the city’s long-term urban vision, ensuring infrastructure growth, lifestyle attractions, and sustained property demand.</li><li>High ROI &amp; Rental Appeal – Branded waterfront residences in Dubai consistently command premium rental yields and strong resale potential.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1774,"cta":{"id":2568,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_BRUNELLO_at_Dubai_Islands_Branded_Resid